## Title: TwizHeal
## Notes: Heal from the game's own party and raid frames: hover a frame and press your TwizHeal key, or Alt+click it (Alt+right-click = fast heal, Ctrl+Alt+click = HoT). Right-sized ranks, smart HoTs, tanks before healers before damage when health can be read.
